{"speciesId":203,"names":{"fr":"Girafarig","es":"Girafarig","en":"Girafarig","ja":"キリンリキ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Its tail has a small brain of its own. Beware! If you get close, it may react to your scent and bite."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its tail, which also contains a small brain, may bite on its own if it notices an alluring smell."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"When it is in danger, its tail uses some sort of mysterious powers to drive away the enemy."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"GIRAFARIG’s rear head also has a brain, but it is small. The rear head attacks in response to smells and sounds. Approaching this POKéMON from behind can cause the rear head to suddenly lash out and bite."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"GIRAFARIG’s rear head contains a tiny brain that is too small for thinking. However, the rear head doesn’t need to sleep, so it can keep watch over its surroundings 24 hours a day."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A GIRAFARIG is an herbivore--it eats grass and tree shoots. While it is eating, its tail makes chewing and swallowing motions as if it were also eating."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its tail, which also contains a small brain, may bite on its own if it notices an alluring smell."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its tail has a small brain of its own. Beware! If you get close, it may react to your scent and bite."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its tail also has a small brain. It bites to repel any foe trying to sneak up on it from behind."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"While it sleeps, the head on its tail keeps watch. The tail doesn’t need to sleep."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The head on its tail contains a small brain. It can instinctively fight even while facing backward."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its tail has a small brain of its own. Beware! If you get close, it may react to your scent by biting."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its tail, which also contains a small brain, may bite on its own if it notices an alluring smell."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La tête qu’il a sur la queue dispose de son propre cerveau et lui permet de couvrir ses arrières."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The head on its tail contains a small brain. It can instinctively fight even while facing backward."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La tête qu’il a sur la queue dispose de son propre cerveau et lui permet de couvrir ses arrières."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The head on its tail contains a small brain. It can instinctively fight even while facing backward."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The head on its tail contains a small brain. It can instinctively fight even while facing backward."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The head on its tail contains a small brain. It can instinctively fight even while facing backward."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"La tête sur sa queue monte la garde quand il dort. Elle n’a pas besoin de dormir."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando duerme, la cabeza de su cola se queda vigilando, ya que ella no necesita dormir."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"While it sleeps, the head on its tail keeps watch. The tail doesn’t need to sleep."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"眠っている あいだ 尻尾の 頭が あたりを 見張っている。 尻尾は 眠らなくても 平気。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa queue possède un cerveau. Si vous vous en approchez, elle vous sentira et vous mordra."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su cola tiene un pequeño cerebro. ¡Cuidado! Si te acercas, puede reaccionar a tu olor y morder."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its tail has a small brain of its own. Beware! If you get close, it may react to your scent by biting."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"尻尾にも 小さな 脳がある。 近寄ると においに 反応して かみついて くるので 注意。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La tête à l’arrière de Girafarig a aussi un cerveau, mais il est plus petit. Elle attaque en réponse aux sons et aux odeurs. Si on approche de ce Pokémon par derrière, cette petite tête peut tout à coup jaillir et mordre."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Girafarig tiene un cerebro también en la cabeza de la cola que reacciona atacando ante olores y sonidos. Cuando alguien se acerca a este Pokémon por la espalda, puede provocar que la cabeza trasera se abalance y lo muerda."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Girafarig’s rear head also has a brain, but it is small. The rear head attacks in response to smells and sounds. Approaching this Pokémon from behind can cause the rear head to suddenly lash out and bite."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"シッポの 頭にも 小さな 脳が ある。 臭いや 音に 反応して 攻撃するので 後ろから 近寄ると いきなり かみつかれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La tête à l’arrière de Girafarig abrite un cerveau trop petit pour penser. En revanche, cette tête arrière n’a pas besoin de dormir, ce qui lui permet de monter la garde tout le temps."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La cabeza trasera de Girafarig tiene un cerebro muy pequeño para pensar, pero, como no le hace falta dormir, al menos puede hacer de centinela las 24 horas del día."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Girafarig’s rear head contains a tiny brain that is too small for thinking. However, the rear head doesn’t need to sleep, so it can keep watch over its surroundings 24 hours a day."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"尻尾の 脳は 考えごとが 出来ないほど 小さいけど 眠らなくても 平気 なので ２４時間 あたりを 見張り続けて いるぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":203,"moves":[{"name":"razor-wind","learns":[[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",13],[